        multi-guest gets only the tags of active conversations and channels they are a member of.


        The `names` parameter looks tags up by name — this is the way to get an `id` from a name known from the
        interface. It accepts no more than 100 names per request, and for more the method responds `400` with the
        `too_long` code.


