        Who belongs to the tag. Suspended employees come in the list, although they are not counted in the tag's own
        `users_count`; deleted ones do not come. Bots marked with the tag also make it into the results.


        The membership of a tag is changed in an employee's profile — [Edit employee](PUT /users/{id}) with the
