  /users/{user_id}/status:
    get:
      operationId: UserStatusOperations_getUserStatus
      description: >-
        Employee status


        The status of another employee: the emoji, the title, the expiry, and away mode.


        For a multi-guest the method returns statuses only of those who come to them in [List employees](GET /users),
        and responds `404` for the rest.


        If no status is set, the method returns `200` and `null` in the response body — with no wrapper object. A status
        whose `expires_at` has passed may still be returned for a short time until it is cleared, so check `expires_at`
        on the client side.
      parameters:
