    delete:
      operationId: UserStatusOperations_deleteUserStatus
      description: >-
        Delete employee status


        Removes the status from another employee, along with away mode and its text. Available to the workspace owner
        and an administrator; not to a bot.


        If there was no status, the response is still `204`. Your own status is removed by [Delete own status](DELETE
        /profile/status).
      parameters:
